Background:  The story attempts to answer several historical mysteries by presenting a fictional way to logically leading to their answers.  I will describe how what is known as the antikeythera mechanism (aka. DEVICE) was built for Mithridates VI (a.k.a. m6)of Pontus. 

He used the device's ability to predict very obvious conjuctions/alignments etc as a logistics tool.  By giving orders to occur he knew he could not tell troops across a vast area to all act on March 7th, as there was too much varience in different calendars.  But he could order 'when mars, venus , and jupiter are all in aries , DO THIS!'

He was such a strategical genius that he planned and properly excecuted events many years in advance.

Plot:

