1. Precision Scheduling: Mithridates could send orders to different regions with astronomical markers like: "When Mars, Mercury, and Jupiter align in Aries, perform the action." The timing of these alignments would be predictable, so he could give each region its own unique set of instructions tied to when theyâ€™ll occur in the sky. For example:
